{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/42d62efc4aa86c8b87355be4ab88cdb0.poster.avif?t=1752736959\" width=550 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/42d62efc4aa86c8b87355be4ab88cdb0.webm?t=1752736959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/42d62efc4aa86c8b87355be4ab88cdb0.mp4?t=1752736959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>&quot;Beyond the Curtains&quot; is a relaxing game about gazing out the window, waiting for interesting moments and delightful surprises. You'll experience the world through the eyes of a room's owner, discovering what lies beyond a single window's frame. Even the fleeting silhouettes of passersby become clues to glimpse into their changing lives. And as time flows by, shifts in the room's interior might just reveal some personal secrets about its mysterious occupant...<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/2a7386b1f4470dcd727447ba9fdca4ba.poster.avif?t=1752736959\" width=550 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/2a7386b1f4470dcd727447ba9fdca4ba.webm?t=1752736959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/2a7386b1f4470dcd727447ba9fdca4ba.mp4?t=1752736959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As players cycle through day and night, time truly moves forward<br>And the world outside the window transforms accordingly...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/d9e0b757f884f3bd520fbab16eefd0e2.poster.avif?t=1752736959\" width=550 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/d9e0b757f884f3bd520fbab16eefd0e2.webm?t=1752736959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/d9e0b757f884f3bd520fbab16eefd0e2.mp4?t=1752736959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Small changes?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/232f26afd9712e54f3878179a4972bb4.poster.avif?t=1752736959\" width=550 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/232f26afd9712e54f3878179a4972bb4.webm?t=1752736959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/232f26afd9712e54f3878179a4972bb4.mp4?t=1752736959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Through simple clicks, you can influence certain events and create subtle changes<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/a955694333abff3315e4aadbdabd1950.poster.avif?t=1752736959\" width=550 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/a955694333abff3315e4aadbdabd1950.webm?t=1752736959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/a955694333abff3315e4aadbdabd1950.mp4?t=1752736959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Though the room's owner cannot join in, she has always been part of the town's story<br><br><br>\u25cf A bright spot in tough times: Maybe your classroom or office doesn't have a window, but this one does\u2014and it's always sunny!<br>\u25cf Take control of time: Use the nap button to advance through different time periods at your own pace, so you never miss a moment.<br>\u25cf Customize your soundtrack: Use the in-room audio device to freely choose your favorite radio station.<br>\u25cf Seamless immersion: Minimal buttons for maximum immersion into the room's atmosphere.<br><br><strong>Selectable themes:</strong><br>The Last Leaf: Watch people come and go in heartwarming daily life<br>Scenic Tour: Take the train and enjoy beautiful landscapes and local cuisine<br>The Keeper: Quietly observe the final journeys of those who have passed<br>...with more themes continuously added","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2648940?t=1752736959","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2648940?t=1752736959","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752736959","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752736959","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3001720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/42d62efc4aa86c8b87355be4ab88cdb0.poster.avif?t=1752736959\" width=550 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648940/extras/42d62efc4aa86c8b87355be4ab88cdb0.webm?t=1752736959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com